flowchart LR
  src[Git source] --> xcompile[Docker cross-compile\namd64 server / aarch64 onboard]
  xcompile --> build[Build binaries]
  build --> pkg[Package dist/]
  pkg --> cfg[Fetch / update config\nhost-configs + VPN + certs]
  cfg --> hookInst[Install odc-hook on molt\nmonitor via odc-cli]
  cfg --> depSrv[Deploy hexa-five]
  cfg --> depPi[Deploy rpi-4b / rpi-5]
  hookInst --> verify[Per-host checks + hook status + E2E]
  depSrv --> verify
  depPi --> verify
  verify --> logs[Collect logs on molt]
